{"manifest_version": "2.0", "session_id": "sess_3", "course_id": "course_44e5aadf01", "title": "deeper", "learning_goal": "", "generation_mode": "llm", "total_duration_ms": 47392, "actions": [{"type": "board", "step_id": 2, "board_uid": 1, "title": "换个讲法：骰子叠加", "board_content": "一颗骰子：1~6 机会一样\n→ 方方正正，**不像钟**\n两颗相加：7 最多，2 和 12 最少\n三颗相加：**越来越像钟**", "layout": "newcol", "reveal_gate_step": 1, "page_id": "page-1"}, {"type": "speak", "step_id": 1, "spoken_text": "别想身高了，咱扔骰子。一颗骰子，1到6，每个点数机会一样，方方正正，一点都不像钟。可你扔两颗、三颗，把点数加起来，看这一行，中间的点数出现得最多，两头的越来越少，慢慢就鼓成钟了。"}, {"type": "circle", "step_id": 3, "target_board_uid": 1, "snippet": "不像钟", "color": null, "during_step": 1, "at_ms": 7301}, {"type": "circle", "step_id": 4, "target_board_uid": 1, "snippet": "越来越像钟", "color": null, "during_step": 1, "at_ms": 7301}, {"type": "tts_segment", "step_id": 1, "audio_url": null, "duration_ms": 20861, "tts_cjk": 73, "tts_latin": 2, "speed": 1.0, "skipped": false, "marks": [[0, 0], [1, 258], [2, 517], [3, 776], [4, 1034], [5, 1293], [6, 1500], [7, 1759], [8, 2017], [9, 2276], [10, 2535], [11, 2742], [12, 2987], [13, 3233], [14, 3479], [15, 3725], [16, 3921], [17, 4032], [18, 4278], [19, 4388], [20, 4585], [21, 4831], [22, 5077], [23, 5322], [24, 5568], [25, 5814], [26, 6060], [27, 6306], [28, 6552], [29, 6748], [30, 6994], [31, 7240], [32, 7486], [33, 7731], [34, 7928], [35, 8174], [36, 8420], [37, 8665], [38, 8911], [39, 9157], [40, 9403], [41, 9600], [42, 9841], [43, 10083], [44, 10324], [45, 10566], [46, 10808], [47, 11001], [48, 11243], [49, 11484], [50, 11678], [51, 11919], [52, 12161], [53, 12403], [54, 12644], [55, 12886], [56, 13128], [57, 13321], [58, 13563], [59, 13804], [60, 14046], [61, 14288], [62, 14481], [63, 14723], [64, 14964], [65, 15206], [66, 15447], [67, 15689], [68, 15931], [69, 16172], [70, 16414], [71, 16656], [72, 16897], [73, 17091], [74, 17332], [75, 17574], [76, 17816], [77, 18057], [78, 18299], [79, 18541], [80, 18782], [81, 18976], [82, 19217], [83, 19459], [84, 19701], [85, 19942], [86, 20184], [87, 20426], [88, 20667], [89, 20861]]}, {"type": "board", "step_id": 6, "board_uid": 2, "title": "", "board_content": "每颗骰子：**方方正正**\n相加越多 → 中间越鼓、两边越瘪\n钟形是**相加**造出来的，不是源头自带", "layout": "follow", "reveal_gate_step": 5, "page_id": "page-1"}, {"type": "speak", "step_id": 5, "spoken_text": "看这一行，每颗骰子都方方正正，可加得越多，中间越鼓、两边越瘪。所以关键不是每颗骰子像不像钟，而是相加这个动作把两头拉平、把中间堆高。你选的那个说法，等于说每颗骰子本身就得是钟，可事实上一颗根本不是。好，再看一次刚才的问题。"}, {"type": "circle", "step_id": 7, "target_board_uid": 2, "snippet": "方方正正", "color": null, "during_step": 5, "at_ms": 9285}, {"type": "circle", "step_id": 8, "target_board_uid": 2, "snippet": "相加", "color": null, "during_step": 5, "at_ms": 9285}, {"type": "tts_segment", "step_id": 5, "audio_url": null, "duration_ms": 26531, "tts_cjk": 98, "tts_latin": 0, "speed": 1.0, "skipped": false, "marks": [[0, 0], [1, 243], [2, 486], [3, 729], [4, 972], [5, 1166], [6, 1409], [7, 1652], [8, 1895], [9, 2138], [10, 2381], [11, 2624], [12, 2867], [13, 3110], [14, 3353], [15, 3547], [16, 3790], [17, 4033], [18, 4276], [19, 4519], [20, 4762], [21, 4957], [22, 5200], [23, 5443], [24, 5686], [25, 5929], [26, 6123], [27, 6366], [28, 6609], [29, 6852], [30, 7095], [31, 7290], [32, 7531], [33, 7773], [34, 8015], [35, 8257], [36, 8499], [37, 8740], [38, 8982], [39, 9224], [40, 9466], [41, 9708], [42, 9950], [43, 10191], [44, 10433], [45, 10675], [46, 10869], [47, 11110], [48, 11352], [49, 11594], [50, 11836], [51, 12078], [52, 12320], [53, 12561], [54, 12803], [55, 13045], [56, 13287], [57, 13529], [58, 13771], [59, 14012], [60, 14206], [61, 14448], [62, 14690], [63, 14931], [64, 15173], [65, 15415], [66, 15609], [67, 15854], [68, 16099], [69, 16344], [70, 16589], [71, 16834], [72, 17079], [73, 17324], [74, 17520], [75, 17766], [76, 18011], [77, 18256], [78, 18501], [79, 18746], [80, 18991], [81, 19236], [82, 19481], [83, 19727], [84, 19972], [85, 20217], [86, 20462], [87, 20707], [88, 20903], [89, 21148], [90, 21393], [91, 21639], [92, 21884], [93, 22129], [94, 2237